export class ModalCobroHistorialCtrl{static $inject=["$http","$uibModalInstance","mainService","modalService","nombreModal","toastService","formulario","params"];constructor($http,$uibModalInstance,_mS,_modalSvc,_nombreModal,_toastr,_form,_params){this.$http=$http,this.$uibModalInstance=$uibModalInstance,this._mS=_mS,this._modalSvc=_modalSvc,this._nombreModal=_nombreModal,this._form=_form;let{historialCobros:historialCobros,data:data,TIPO_DOC:TIPO_DOC}=_params;this.historialCobros=historialCobros,this.data=data,this.TIPO_DOC=TIPO_DOC}$onInit(){console.log(this);for(let item of this.historialCobros){let idCI=item.comprobanteIngreso.idComprobanteIngreso;this._mS.getData("get",`/Cobro/GetByDocument?idComprobanteIngreso=${idCI}&idTipoDoc=${this.TIPO_DOC.idTipoDocumento}&idComprobante=${this.data.id}`).then(response=>{item.cobros=response.data,item.showCobro=!0})}}getCobroDetalle(data){data.showDetalle=!data.showDetalle,this._mS.getData("get",`/CobroDetalle/GetByIdCobro?idCobro=${data.cobro.idCobro}&idTipoDoc=${this.TIPO_DOC.idTipoDocumento}&idComprobante=${this.data.id}`).then(response=>{data.cobroDetalles=response.data})}closeModal(){this.$uibModalInstance.close()}}